# This app has no client-side secrets. `.env.local` (gitignored, auto-written by
# `npx convex dev`) only holds the non-secret Convex deployment URL.
#
# Every real credential — OpenAI, Bluesky, Composio — lives server-side in Convex's
# environment, never in a file in this repo:
#
#   npx convex env set OPENAI_API_KEY sk-...
#   npx convex env set BLUESKY_HANDLE yourhandle.bsky.social
#   npx convex env set BLUESKY_APP_PASSWORD xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx
#   npx convex env set COMPOSIO_API_KEY ...
#
# See README.md "Setup" and docs/composio-setup.md for the full walkthrough.
